					"nextDialogs": [
						230163902
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230163902,
					"content": "啊哈！成功了，這個齒輪不錯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230163903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230163903,
					"content": "齒間距…厚度…大小…我得拿個尺來看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230163904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230163904,
					"content": "#就讓加爾恰先生去測量資料吧，旅行者，這些報酬給{F#妳}{M#你}，請{F#妳}{M#你}收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230163905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 230163905,
					"content": "你還抱著謹慎悲觀的態度嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230163906
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230163906,
					"content": "是的，我一直是這樣的態度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230163907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 230163907,
					"content": "我和加爾恰先生正在一座大山前徘徊，現在我們只是在山腳下搬開了一小塊石頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230163908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 230163908,
					"content": "但事實上，我們根本就沒找到能進入山裡的路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230163909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 230163909,
					"content": "希望加爾恰先生的才能，能引導著我們走上正確的道路…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230163910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 230163910,
					"content": "不然我就只能默唸那句「車到山前必有路」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				}
			]
		},
